                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A living rune can move only along flat surfaces. If the surface it's on is destroyed (such as a portrait hit by a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fireball] spell or a wall being smashed), the rune takes @Damage[7d6[untyped]] damage and is shunted to the nearest flat surface. If there is no flat surface within 5 feet, the rune is destroyed.</p>"
